{
  "version": 1,
  "meta": {
    "author": "alpha",
    "updated": "2026-02-18T12:00:00Z",
    "notes": [
      "All numeric clamps are inclusive. In DEV builds, validators reject on violation; in PROD, loaders clamp then warn.",
      "This file is authoritative for shapes, defaults, enums, and clamps. Eid iteration determinism is handled by the ECS registry, not by this schema.",
      "Transient components (transient=true) are excluded from save serialization by default.",
      "Renderable.tintToken, when non-null, should map to an entry in data/visual/color-palette.json (loader cross-check optional for MVP).",
      "Tile invariants: hardness must equal the band for the tileType (rock=3, floor=0, ore.copper=4, ore.iron=5, ore.quartz=7).",
      "Tile.flags must be non-negative and only set known TILE_FLAGS bits.",
      "Inventory.items length must be ≤ capacity; on overflow, the loader trims items from the end with a warning.",
      "AI.cooldownMsRange.max must be ≥ min; when both are 0, systems may substitute per-enemy defaults.",
      "position.dirDeg is normalized to [0..359] with wrap semantics (mod 360).",
      "attack_intent.attackId must be a non-empty string when spawned; empty is invalid.",
      "Combat baselines (examples, not schema defaults): Player: health.max≈100, stamina.max≈100, poise.max≈50; Grunts: health.max≈30–50, stamina.max≈40–60, poise.max≈20–35."
    ]
  },
